    turnFlow: 'Play starts left of dealer and proceeds clockwise. On turn, a player either stands or tries to swap with the left neighbor. A normal neighbor must swap, but top five matadors change this. Cuckoo stops further swapping and triggers immediate reveal. Dragon and Katt refuse the swap and force the attacker to pay a token. Hest and Hus pass the attacker onward so they must try the next player instead. When play reaches dealer, dealer may exchange with the undealt stock with the same matador consequences; when a pass reaches dealer, draw replacement pieces until a non-pass value appears. At round end all reveal. Lowest value pays one token to pool; ties for lowest each pay.',
